senteren"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}},{"descriptions":[{"language":"EN","value":"Being well-informed about societal, political and discipline-related developments and being aware of own role and influence within these developments."},{"language":"NL","value":"Goed geïnformeerd zijn over de maatschappelijke, politieke en vakinhoudelijke ontwikkelingen en zich bewust zijn van de eigen rol en invloed binnen deze ontwikkelingen."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code":"10","id":"10","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Societal awareness"},{"language":"NL","value":"Maatschappelijke bewustzijn"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}},{"descriptions":[{"language":"EN","value":"Critically evaluating own and others’ behaviour, viewpoints or methods, and being open to evaluation by others. Being able to learn from these evaluations by changing own behaviour, viewpoints or methods."},{"language":"NL","value":"Het kritisch evalueren van (eigen) gedrag, standpunten of methoden en open staan voor evaluatie door anderen. Het vermogen om te leren van deze evaluaties door wijziging van het eigen gedrag, standpunten of methoden."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code":"11","id":"11","names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Reflecting"},{"language":"NL","value":"Reflecteren"}],"subType":"skill","type":"skill"}},{"descriptions":[{"language":"EN","value":"Self-directing own process of absorbing and applying new knowledge and information."},{"language":"NL","value":"Zelf sturing geven aan het eigen proces van nieuwe kennis en informatie opnemen en toepassen."}],"levels":[{"code":"V","color":{"background":"#2bb14d"},"names":[{"language":"EN","value":"Contributes"},{"language":"NL","value":"Draagt bij aan"}]}],"reference":{"code"